sequenceDiagram
    participant L as "LLM"
    participant M as "MainAgentState"
    participant D as "dispatch"
    participant S as "SafeSubgraphNode"
    participant I as "task_indexing workflow"
    participant R as "RAG / task service"

    L->>M: assistant tool_call(task_indexing_agent, id)
    M->>D: pending_tool_calls
    D->>S: active_tool_call(id, args)
    S->>I: invoke child graph with parent state
    I->>R: query / start / wait for RAG

    alt Index completed
        R-->>I: RAG completed
        I-->>S: ToolMessage(id) + success ActionResult
    else Precondition or RAG failure
        R-->>I: partial search / RAG failure
        I-->>S: ToolMessage(id) + error ActionResult
    end

    S-->>M: messages(add_messages), last_action_result, active_tool_call=None
    M->>D: dispatch remaining calls or solve
    D->>L: resolved ToolMessage for the same id

    Note over I,M: Child state must declare messages with add_messages reducer.
    Note over I,M: Otherwise the ToolMessage is discarded and the next LLM call returns 400.
